<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="feature_sensor" xml:lang="zh-CN">
  <title>传感器联动</title>
  <shortdesc>温湿度、光照、门窗等传感器为主机提供环境感知能力，是自动化规则的重要数据来源。</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <author type="organization"><keyword keyref="company-name"/></author>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>传感器</indexterm>
        <indexterm>温湿度</indexterm>
        <indexterm>联动</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname><keyword keyref="product-name"/></prodname>
        <vrmlist><vrm version="1.0"/></vrmlist>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
<p>所有传感器的实时数值在控制台卡片中展示，历史曲线保留 90 天。传感器数值本身不直接驱动设备，需要通过自动化规则产生行为。</p>
    <note type="important"><p>传感器上报存在采样间隔（默认 60 秒），依赖传感器触发的自动化同样受此间隔约束，追求即时响应的场景请改用即时类触发器。</p></note><section>
      <title>常用联动策略</title>
      <table id="sensor-recipes">
        <title>常见传感器联动配方</title>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <thead><row><entry>传感器</entry><entry>触发条件</entry><entry>推荐动作</entry></row></thead>
          <tbody>
            <row><entry>温湿度</entry><entry>湿度高于 70%</entry><entry>除湿机开启</entry></row>
            <row><entry>光照</entry><entry>光照低于 50 lux 且人在家</entry><entry>自动开灯</entry></row>
            <row><entry>门窗</entry><entry>夜间 23 点后开启</entry><entry>推送告警</entry></row>
            <row><entry>人体</entry><entry>离家布防后侦测到活动</entry><entry>安防告警链</entry></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </section>    <section>
      <title>传感器校准</title>
      <p>温湿度传感器支持偏移校准：在设备详情页选择 <menucascade><uicontrol>设置</uicontrol><uicontrol>校准</uicontrol></menucascade>，参照标准温度计输入偏移值，范围 ±5°C。</p>
    </section>
  </conbody>
</concept>
